BT 0.1 g /F2 24 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 770 Tm (A Zettelkasten primer) Tj ET
BT 0.45 g /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 734 Tm (How small, linked notes turn reading into writing. A sample for the Kasten dev vault.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 711 Tm (A Zettelkasten, or slip box, is a way of keeping notes so that they keep working after you) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 694 Tm (write them. Each note is small, written in your own words and linked to the notes it) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 677 Tm (belongs with. Over time the links, not the folders, become the structure of what you) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 660 Tm (know.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 g /F2 13.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 625 Tm (1. One idea per note) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 599 Tm (A note should hold one idea, written in your own words, so that it can be understood) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 582 Tm (without the context it came from. Small notes are easy to link, easy to move and easy to) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 565 Tm (reuse in a new argument. When a note grows a second idea, split it in two and link the) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 548 Tm (halves.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 g /F2 13.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 513 Tm (2. Link as you write) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 487 Tm (Every new note is placed next to the notes it belongs with. Ask which existing note it) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 470 Tm (continues, contradicts or supports, and link it there. Links are cheaper than folders: a) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 453 Tm (note can sit in many conversations at once, and each link records why two ideas meet.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 g /F2 13.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 418 Tm (3. Let structure emerge) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 392 Tm (Do not design the structure before the notes exist. Clusters of densely linked notes) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 375 Tm (become topics of their own, and an index note that points to the entry points of each) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 358 Tm (cluster is enough to find your way back in. Structure is the result of the work, not its) Tj ET
BT 0.15 g /F1 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 341 Tm (precondition.) Tj ET
